te the following steps. Fill in the Self Assessment.\n"}], "type": "post_instructions"}, {"contents": [{"type": "skill", "content": "Reading"}, {"type": "skill", "content": "Writing"}, {"type": "skill", "content": "Speaking"}], "type": "learning_skills"}], "id": 11}], "type": "scholar", "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "has_nav", "content": true}, {"type": "has_exercise_controls", "content": true}], "type": "lab_options"}], "stimuli": [{"contents": [{}], "type": "welcome", "_data": [], "id": 0, "template_override": 1}, {"contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"images": [{"time": "0", "text": "", "id": 0, "image": "engenn11le07ob02re2img01.jpg"}, {"time": "100", "text": "<span class=\"strong\"> Vanessa: </span>\tHello? <br /><span class=\"strong\"> Peter: </span>\t\tHi Vanessa. I've decided to do it. <br /><span class=\"strong\"> Vanessa: </span> \tDo what? <br /><span class=\"strong\"> Peter: </span>\t\tWe were talking about the dangers of eating too much fat and sugar and, as a result, I've decided to do a cleanse. <br /><span class=\"strong\"> Vanessa: </span> \tThat's great Peter.", "id": 1, "image": "engenn11le07ob02re2img01.jpg"}, {"time": "14000", "text": "<span class=\"strong\"> Peter: </span> \tThe problem is that I don't really know how. If I cut out all those things, what do I eat? I removed all the sugar, fat, meat and dairy from my kitchen with the result that there's nothing left except a few spices. If I had to live on what's in the fridge now, I would waste away to nothing. <br /><span class=\"strong\"> Vanessa: </span> \tWell, lucky for you, I'm a chef. Therefore, I can help you with some meals that you can throw together that don't have any of the ingredients that you are trying to avoid.  Long ago I worked in a vegan restaurant, resulting in the creation of lots of recipes that you can use. If there were more demand, I would open a small vegan restaurant. It's healthy and delicious if you make it right.", "id": 2, "image": "engenn11le07ob02re2img02.jpg"}, {"time": "57000", "text": "<span class=\"strong\"> Peter: </span>\t\tRecipes? You mean I can't just buy the food ready-made? If I could cook, I would open my own restaurant. <br />\n<span class=\"strong\"> Vanessa: </span> \tIt's not difficult. I'm going to e-mail you some recipes when I get home tonight. I'll send you some simple ones first. If I weren't so busy I'd come and cook with you. A couple people are away this weekend and as a result I'm working all weekend.\n<span class=\"strong\">", "id": 3, "image": "engenn11le07ob02re2img05.jpg"}, {"time": "80500", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter: </span> \t\tThat's okay. I'll have a look at them and see what I can do on my own. Maybe I'll ask Amy if she can help me. If I lost some weight, it would probably make her happy! She should support me in this! <br />\n<span class=\"strong\"> Vanessa: </span>\t I'm sure she will. But don't forget \u2026 it's more about being healthy than getting thin.", "id": 4, "image": "engenn11le07ob02re2img05.jpg"}], "audiosrc": "engenn11le07ob02re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn11le07ob02re2img01.jpg"}}], "id": 1, "template_override": 1, "type": "audio", "title": "", "_data": []}], "id": 0}]}